# Craft (CR 702.167a): "{3}{R}{R}, Exile this artifact, Exile another artifact you control or an artifact card from your
# graveyard: Return this card transformed under its owner's control. Craft only as a sorcery." Bot1 casts Dire Flail and
# an Ornithopter, then crafts in the same main phase with Black Lotus and two Moxen, choosing the Ornithopter on the
# battlefield as the material. The material and the Flail are exiled as the cost is paid, so with the ability on the
# stack both are already in exile; it resolves into Dire Blunderbuss, a new object (CR 400.7) with the back face's
# characteristics (CR 712.8e): an Equipment, red by its color indicator, unattached. The Moxen and the Lotus are
# artifacts too: the choice is the player's.

